      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is the name of the project. The name is a play on Client for URLs, originally with URL spelled ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3148.90625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 69,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "The curl project produces two products:",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3237.90625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "libcurl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "libcurl",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3284.296875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 27,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "23.4px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "A client-side URL transfer library, supporting DICT, FILE, FTP, FTPS, GOPHER, GOPHERS, HTTP, HTTPS, ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3334.6875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 69,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "libcurl supports HTTPS certificates, HTTP POST, HTTP PUT, FTP uploading, Kerberos, SPNEGO, HTTP form",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3423.6875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 69,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "libcurl is highly portable, it builds and works identically on numerous platforms. The internals doc",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3512.6875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "libcurl is free, thread-safe, IPv6 compatible, feature-rich, well supported and fast.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3578.6875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "curl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3625.078125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 27,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "23.4px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "A command line tool for getting or sending data using URL syntax.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3675.46875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Since curl uses libcurl, curl supports the same wide range of common Internet protocols that libcurl",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3718.46875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We pronounce curl with an initial k sound. It rhymes with words like girl and earl. This is a short ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3761.46875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "There are numerous sub-projects and related projects that also use the word curl in the project name",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3827.46875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 92,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "what-is-libcurl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "What is libcurl?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3944.359375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "libcurl is a reliable and portable library for doing Internet data transfers using one or more of it",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4003.25,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "You can use libcurl freely in your application, be it open source, commercial or closed-source.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4069.25,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "libcurl is most probably the most portable, most powerful and most often used C-based multi-platform",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4112.25,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "what-is-curl-not",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "What is curl not?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4183.140625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is not a Wget clone. That is a common misconception. Never, during curl's development, have we ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4242.03125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is not a website mirroring program. If you want to use curl to mirror something: fine, go ahead",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4308.03125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is not an FTP site mirroring program. Sure, get and send FTP with curl but if you want systemat",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4374.03125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is not a PHP tool, even though it works perfectly well when used from or with PHP (when using t",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4440.03125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is not a program for a single operating system. curl exists, compiles, builds and runs under a ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4506.03125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 69,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "when-would-you-make-curl-do--",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "When would you make curl do ... ?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4599.921875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We love suggestions of what to change in order to make curl and libcurl better. We do however believ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4658.8125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl the command line tool is to remain a non-graphical command line tool. If you want GUIs or fancy",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4724.8125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We do not add things to curl that other small and available tools already do well at the side. curl'",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4790.8125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We focus on protocol related issues and improvements. If you want to do more with the supported prot",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4856.8125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "If you want someone else to do all the work while you wait for us to implement it for you, that is n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4922.8125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 92,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "If you write the code, chances are better that it gets into curl faster.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5034.8125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "who-makes-curl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Who makes curl?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5082.703125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl and libcurl are not made by any single individual. Daniel Stenberg is project leader and main d",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5141.59375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 92,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "The full list of all contributors is found in the docs/THANKS file.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5253.59375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is developed by a community, with Daniel at the wheel.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5296.59375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "what-do-you-get-for-making-curl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "What do you get for making curl?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5344.484375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Project curl is entirely free and open. We do this voluntarily, mostly in our spare time. Companies ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5403.375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We get help from companies. Haxx provides website, bandwidth, mailing lists etc, GitHub hosts the pr",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5469.375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 69,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "If you want to support our project, consider a donation or a banner-program or even better: by helpi",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5558.375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "what-about-curl-from-curlcom",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "What about CURL from curl.com?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5629.265625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "During the summer of 2001, curl.com was busy advertising their client-side programming language for ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5688.15625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We are in no way associated with curl.com or their CURL programming language.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5754.15625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Our project name curl has been in effective use since 1998. We were not the first computer related p",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5797.15625,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We recognize that we are living in parallel with curl.com and wish them every success.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5863.15625,
      "w": 1000,
