      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Please do not mail any single individual unless you really need to. Keep curl-related questions on a",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5969.9375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Keeping curl-related questions and discussions on mailing lists allows others to join in and help, t",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6035.9375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 92,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "If you have found or suspect a security problem in curl or libcurl, submit all the details to us. We",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6147.9375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 92,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Security issues can also be taken to the curl security team by emailing security at curl.se (closed ",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6259.9375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "where-do-i-buy-commercial-support-for-curl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Where do I buy commercial support for curl?",
