      "y": 6330.828125,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl is fully open source. It means you can hire any skilled engineer to fix your curl-related probl",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6389.71875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We list available alternatives.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6432.71875,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "how-many-are-using-curl",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "How many are using curl?",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6480.609375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 34,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "It is impossible to tell.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6539.5,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We do not know how many users that knowingly have installed and use curl.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6582.5,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We do not know how many users that use curl without knowing that they are in fact using it.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6625.5,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We do not know how many users that downloaded or installed curl and then never use it.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6668.5,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "In 2025, we estimate that curl runs in roughly thirty billion installations world wide.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6711.5,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "why-do-you-not-update-ca-bundlecrt",
      "classes": "",
