      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "The US government restricts exports of software that contains or uses cryptography. When doing so, t",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7255.84375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Apache Software Foundation has a good explanation of ECCN.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7321.84375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "We believe curl's number might be ECCN 5D002, another possibility is 5D992. It seems necessary to wr",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7364.84375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Comprehensible explanations of the meaning of such numbers and how to obtain them (resp.) are here a",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7430.84375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 46,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "An incomprehensible description of the two numbers above is available on bis.doc.gov",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7496.84375,
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 23,
      "font": "arial, helvetica, ariel, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
