      "display": "block",
      "float": "none",
      "position": "static"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "curl has been written to use a generic SSL function layer internally, and that SSL functionality can",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8507.875,
